        "original_id": "454c8d38-10d6-5a7b-9f45-a1eb7f7f66fd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daragh O'Malley, Bob Hoskins, Helen Mirren\n- Works: The Long Good Friday, Withnail and I, Tales of The Unexpected, Waking the Dead, Wire in the Blood, Silent Witness, Vera, Longitude, Cleopatra, The Magnificent Seven, Vendetta, Camelot, Shaughnessy\n- Topics: Film and television roles\n\nFacts:\n- Daragh O'Malley first appeared in roles in the films The Long Good Friday and Withnail and I.\n- Daragh O'Malley later had leading guest roles in the UK television series Tales of The Unexpected, Waking the Dead, Wire in the Blood, Silent Witness, and Vera.\n- Daragh O'Malley also appeared in Longitude, Cleopatra for ABC, The Magnificent Seven for CBS, and the US television films Vendetta, Camelot, and Shaughnessy.\n- The Long Good Friday is a British gangster film starring Bob Hoskins and Helen Mirren.",
